        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md\r",
          "ACCOUNT_ID is only the unique identifier; it is not used to calculate clusters.\r",
          "K-Means uses only:\r",
          "- CYCLE_2_NORM\r",
          "- CYCLE_3_NORM\r",
          "- CYCLE_4_NORM\r",
          "It starts with five initial centroids, assigns each account to the nearest centroid, recalculates each centroid as the mean of its assigned accounts’ three cycle values, and repeats until the groups stabilize.\r",
          "So each cluster represents accounts with similar cycle behaviour."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
